---
import { normalizeSurnames } from '../../lib/surnames';
const modules = import.meta.glob('../../data/surnames.json', { eager: true, import: 'default' });
const hasSurnames = normalizeSurnames(Object.values(modules)[0]).length > 0;
---

<section class="studio-surname-picker" data-surname-picker aria-label="百家姓资料">
  <h2>百家姓 · 找到自己的姓</h2>
  <p class="studio-note">选择姓氏，预览起源、迁徙与宗族资料。资料仅供寻根参考，请结合本家支派核实。</p>
  <label
    >搜索姓氏<input
      type="search"
      disabled={!hasSurnames}
      data-surname-search
      placeholder="输入简繁体姓氏、拼音或英文拼法"
    /></label
  >
  <p class="studio-note" data-surname-count role="status">
    {hasSurnames ? '正在读取百家姓资料…' : '百家姓资料整理中，你仍可在下方填写并保存家族资料。'}
  </p>
  <div class="studio-surname-grid" data-surname-grid></div>
  <div class="studio-surname-preview" data-surname-preview hidden></div>
  <div data-surname-actions hidden>
    <p class="studio-note">本章资料会填入下方表单，检查后点击“保存这一章”。已有文字会保留，资料以标记段落追加。</p>
    <label class="studio-consent"><input type="checkbox" data-surname-step="3" /> 同时保存迁徙资料到第 3 章</label>
    <label class="studio-consent"
      ><input type="checkbox" data-surname-step="4" /> 同时保存堂号、郡望与字辈到第 4 章</label
    >
    <button type="button" class="button" data-surname-import>一键引入本姓资料</button>
  </div>
  <p class="studio-note" data-surname-status role="status"></p>
</section>
<style is:global>
  .studio-surname-picker {
    margin-block: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid #d9cbb9;
    border-radius: 1rem;
  }
  .studio-surname-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(4.5rem, 1fr));
    gap: 0.5rem;
    max-height: 20rem;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 0.25rem;
  }
  .studio-surname-chip {
    min-height: 3rem;
    padding: 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid #d9cbb9;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    background: #fffaf3;
    color: #503729;
  }
  .studio-surname-chip[aria-pressed='true'] {
    background: #503729;
    color: #fffaf3;
  }
  .studio-surname-chip:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid #a36d38;
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .studio-surname-preview {
    margin-block: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: #fffaf3;
    color: #503729;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .studio-surname-preview dt {
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
  .studio-surname-preview dd {
    margin: 0.25rem 0;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
  }
  .studio-surname-picker .button {
    white-space: normal;
  }
</style>
